The bug occurs because the check for the `ns` pointer being NULL was moved, allowing the code to attempt to access `ns->head->ns_id` without confirming that `ns` is valid. If `nvme_find_get_ns` returns NULL, the subsequent code will dereference a NULL pointer, leading to incorrect behavior when printing the namespace ID.

